{"summary":"Amazing graphics and very small app size","description":"Hello Players,\n\nI created my Checkers app as example of good checkers for me and posted it on the store as free board game for you.\nI hope you enjoy it and get a lot pleasure from playing. :)\n\nFeatures:\n\n- supports twelve different rules of checkers\n- ten levels of difficulty\n- 2 player mode\n- game assistant (Helper)\n- auto-save function\n- seven themes (white, dark, light, grey, gold, art and black)\n- two board views (Vertical - 2D and Horizontal - 3D)\n- realistic graphics\n- sound effects\n- some help about rules\n- small size\n\nRules:\n\n- American Checkers (English Draughts) \n- Russian Checkers\n- Brazilian Checkers\n- International Checkers (Polish)\n- Spanish Checkers\n- Italian Checkers\n- Thai Checkers also called Makhos\n- Turkish Checkers\n- Czech Checkers\n- Pool Checkers\n- Ghanaian Checkers (Damii)\n- Nigerian Checkers (Drafts)\n\nYou can help me make the game better.\nIf you have any comments or suggestions, please write them here. I will read your reviews and go ahead!\n\nThank you!\n\nAlex F.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$3.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jsyfY_HWEJE?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RDT82G2nHehsUsQBmIrjtUvbgcVUw76st4bE5vPpVDwnYIeXdmqEK1T1Ld6SSUPUSH-up3L63B0349Aj3T83LQ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0UiRQMvZPMXYlWIrrLLvnzUNsfKYrxMzkBOeWOS6daakaA5isPbX2M1iWgbSBwto23HLVCHWqVHbPCBTmOciUw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hBVzsgmPYmASD2lNM7WPZjgXhX-v4TM1I2VM2C7tt4V5NbK3EMmLi8nf4G91gkIjhjsnNVG9WTGBU4TMGpL4","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/l0bK6pkDrM7DRRZXDkX84W-PW07v7zb_qFFKfRqly1av28v-0RMVzWY-40ch9IXyOfGU1tXcItXDxHUamXol","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/obrFOLzfz7e83K6L6IDLht4n3yIb98bF2RSpWVUBd5o6nUTkqeqXnhMCnjVHHaA8kQ8d6TMcC7nWZqMCHgWxUg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ui1fHsv5SBSGSF6IKjOJEwf3JO5jl3K6Wgz2XWLk9fyFY